WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.446
Welcome to BookLens, your study companion from IEC.

00:00:04.446 --> 00:00:09.720
Add it to your home screen, and it opens just like an app.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.560
No download, and no sign-up to start.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:21.814
Pick your subject, then load the ready-made sample book — or upload your own PDF or Word document.

00:00:21.814 --> 00:00:23.940
Your book opens, ready to study.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:30.548
Press play, and the studio narrator reads the page aloud, following every sentence.

00:00:30.548 --> 00:00:35.170
Choose a voice you like, and set the speed that suits you.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.554
Studying in another language?

00:00:38.554 --> 00:00:45.690
Switch the reader between English, Arabic, and Spanish — or translate the whole page in one tap.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:50.421
Select any text to highlight it in your colour.

00:00:50.421 --> 00:00:53.900
Every highlight is collected for you in the Highlights panel.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.726
Turn a highlight into a flashcard with one tap.

00:00:58.726 --> 00:01:04.820
Study your deck, flip each card — and download the set as a PDF when you are ready.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.266
Create your free profile to keep everything in one place:

00:01:10.266 --> 00:01:15.650
your library, where you left off, and the assignments your mentor shares with you.

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.553
Questions or ideas?

00:01:18.553 --> 00:01:22.026
Tap Feedback and tell us what you think.

00:01:22.026 --> 00:01:25.500
BookLens — turn any chapter into a study session.
